      "writtenOn": "2022-02-02T15:50:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sure. I\u0027m aware that using the enum-name as a source of truth is not ideal, but I don\u0027t know what the possibilities of editing the spreadsheet are.\n\nThe rule now is to use only Zephyr GPIO API, not the one from the shim. The GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW flag is actually a feature(recommended by Keith) we can use in the case of WP.\n\nI\u0027ll wait for Keith\u0027s opinion.",
      "parentUuid": "ec6cdecc_3554e167",
      "revId": "9c16779279144739b34a6c67a87d8b818445e6ab",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e963db4c_1c05484f",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1281040
