      "writtenOn": "2022-02-03T11:34:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the change.\n\nThe gpio shim layer uses gpio_pin_get_raw function that doesn\u0027t care about ACTIVE_LOW flag. Anyway, I agree that we should do that pin after pin, not all at once. \n\nI\u0027m not sure if the interrupt checks physical or logical state.",
      "parentUuid": "e963db4c_1c05484f",
      "revId": "9c16779279144739b34a6c67a87d8b818445e6ab",
